<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa's Stals cautious on FX controls.</title>
<headline>S.Africa's Stals cautious on FX controls.</headline>
<dateline>PRETORIA 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>A sharp fall in the rand this year had forced the authorities to be more cautious about easing South Africa's foreign exchange controls, the country's Reserve Bank Governor Chris Stals said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;We will be much more cautious at this stage to relax on exchange controls but we think the process of gradually reducing exchange controls must continue,&quot; he told reporters at the central bank's annual meeting.</p>
</text>
